
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Consult an Astrologer | Narsimha Astro</title>

  <style>
    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      font-family: Georgia, serif;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #3b0712, #780d25);
      color: #fff5df;
      min-height: 100vh;
    }

    nav {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 20px 8%;
      background: #370711;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #c99b42;
    }

    .logo {
      font-size: 24px;
      font-weight: bold;
      color: #f3c66d;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .home-link {
      color: #f3c66d;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 16px;
    }

    .container {
      min-height: calc(100vh - 150px);
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 60px 20px;
    }

    .symbol {
      font-size: 70px;
      color: #f3c66d;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: clamp(34px, 6vw, 65px);
      color: #ffd477;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    h2 {
      font-size: 27px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    p {
      max-width: 650px;
      line-height: 1.8;
      font-size: 17px;
      color: #f2d8bb;
    }

    .services {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 20px;
      margin-top: 40px;
    }

    .service {
      padding: 20px 30px;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
      border: 1px solid #b58b4a;
      border-radius: 12px;
      min-width: 160px;
    }

    .launch {
      margin-top: 45px;
      padding: 13px 32px;
      background: #e8b65c;
      color: #3b0712;
      border-radius: 30px;
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    footer {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 25px;
      border-top: 1px solid #9c703c;
      color: #e4c9a4;
    }

    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      nav {
        padding: 18px 5%;
      }

      .logo {
        font-size: 19px;
      }

      .services {
        flex-direction: column;
        width: 100%;
        max-width: 300px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <nav>
    <a href="/" class="logo">Narsimha Astro</a>

  </nav>

  <main class="container">

    <div class="symbol">✦</div>

    <h1>Coming Soon</h1>

    <h2>Consult an Astrologer</h2>

    <p>
      Narsimha Astro is preparing to bring you
      personalized astrology consultations with
      experienced astrologers.

      Our consultation services will be available soon.
    </p>

    <div class="services">
      <div class="service">💬 Chat Consultation</div>
      <div class="service">📞 Voice Consultation</div>
      <div class="service">🎥 Video Consultation</div>
    </div>

    <div class="launch">
      Launching Soon
    </div>

  </main>

  <footer>
    © 2026 Narsimha Astro. All Rights Reserved.
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
